                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \Gamma_X(A)
              as above is the homotopy-correct
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/derived+hom-space"} derived section space
          %h3#relation_to_exponential_objects__internal_homs Relation to exponential objects / internal homs
          %p
            As a special case of prop.
            %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#RelationToSections"}
            one obtains
            = succeed "/" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/exponential+objects"} exponential objects
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/internal+homs"} internal homs
          %p
            Let
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
