                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} [X,A]
          %h3#relation_to_type_theory_and_quantification_in_logic Relation to type theory and quantification in logic
          %p
            The dependent product is the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/categorical+semantics"} categorical semantics
            of what in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/type+theory"} type theory
            is the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/type+formation"} formation
            of
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/dependent+product+types"} dependent product types
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/propositions+as+types"} propositions as types
            this corresponds to
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/universal+quantification"} universal quantification
